    "searchText": "Question 4: Foreign subsidiary \nYou are a financial accountant working for Jeffries plc (‘Jeffries’), a UK-based \ncompany that holds investment in one other entity, Suso SA (‘Suso’). Today, you are \npreparing the consolidated financial statements for the year ended 31 March 20X8, in \naccordance with IFRS Accounting Standards. The main business activity of the group \ndoes not include investing in assets or providing finance. \n \nDetails of these companies are included in Appendix 1 and financial statements of \nJeffries and Suso are included in Appendix 2. \n \n \nRequired \n1. Prepare, showing workings, any consolidation journal entries necessary for \nthe year ended 31 March 20X8. \n2. Construct, showing all workings, the Jeffries Group consolidated statement of \nfinancial position as at 31 March 20X8.",
